sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant FE as DiagnosisButton
  participant API as POST /api/diagnostics
  participant SVC as service.startDiagnosis
  participant EV as evidence.buildIncidentContext
  participant DA as AWS DevOps Agent (aidevops)
  participant CW as CloudWatch / Glue / Data API
  participant DDB as bgp-diagnostics
  FE->>API: {taskId, runId}
  API->>SVC: startDiagnosis()
  SVC->>DDB: put running record (return diagnosticId)
  API-->>FE: {diagnosticId, status:running}
  par background (fire-and-forget)
    SVC->>EV: build evidence prompt
    EV->>CW: pull real logs<br/>(Glue ErrorMessage / /aws-glue/jobs/error / DescribeStatement)
    CW-->>EV: log excerpts
    SVC->>DA: ensureAgentSpace → CreateChat(IAM) → SendMessage(evidence)
    DA-->>SVC: event stream (textDelta accumulated)
    Note over SVC,DA: if too short, follow up once for full report
    SVC->>DDB: Update done + report (or failed + error)
  and frontend polling
    loop every 3s, ≤100 times (5 min)
      FE->>API: GET /api/diagnostics/{id}
      API-->>FE: {status, report?}
    end
  end
  Note right of FE: status=done → show structured report
